WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.511
- How do you manage your chill?

00:00:01.511 --> 00:00:05.400
- Uh, realizing we're
all gonna die someday.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.733
- Well that stresses me out.

00:00:15.947 --> 00:00:18.993
- In the past week you worried
about the distant future.

00:00:18.993 --> 00:00:22.184
That's just vague enough
to cause me to worry.

00:00:22.184 --> 00:00:23.165
- In the past week you were worried about

00:00:23.165 --> 00:00:25.329
whether you made a stranger angry.

00:00:25.329 --> 00:00:26.962
It's like I don't give a
*beep* about a stranger.

00:00:26.962 --> 00:00:27.795
- Right.

00:00:27.795 --> 00:00:29.448
- I'm sure I made a stranger angry

00:00:29.448 --> 00:00:30.902
but I'm not worried about it.

00:00:30.902 --> 00:00:31.886
- Oh.

00:00:31.886 --> 00:00:33.950
- Do you worry about
your credit being stolen?

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.356
Or your identity being stolen?

00:00:35.356 --> 00:00:37.184
- I mean, as long as you
check your credit card bill

00:00:37.184 --> 00:00:38.829
every month, you're okay, right?

00:00:38.829 --> 00:00:40.512
- Probably not.

00:00:40.512 --> 00:00:42.009
- Do you have fake arguments in your head?

00:00:42.009 --> 00:00:42.842
- Oh, all the time.

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:43.675
- Okay.

00:00:43.675 --> 00:00:44.508
- Oh yeah.

00:00:44.508 --> 00:00:45.341
- Glad I'm not the only one.

00:00:45.341 --> 00:00:46.174
- I was thinking, I
like to plan out exactly

00:00:46.174 --> 00:00:47.007
what I would say.

00:00:47.007 --> 00:00:48.995
- You've made someone call
you when they got home

00:00:48.995 --> 00:00:51.431
from visiting you to make
sure they got home okay?

00:00:51.431 --> 00:00:54.014
Yeah, that's just basic safety.

00:00:55.463 --> 00:00:57.529
- You're not afraid to poop
in the public restroom.

00:00:57.529 --> 00:00:58.701
- Like what's gonna happen?

00:00:58.701 --> 00:01:01.138
- Like you made a really loud fart.

00:01:01.138 --> 00:01:03.442
Then someone's gonna go like woah,

00:01:03.442 --> 00:01:04.988
I'm gonna remember your shoes

00:01:04.988 --> 00:01:07.006
so that I can make fun of you later.

00:01:07.006 --> 00:01:08.551
- Literally I called my mom this morning

00:01:08.551 --> 00:01:10.902
to try and plan Thanksgiving vacation.

00:01:10.902 --> 00:01:12.115
- It's July.

00:01:12.115 --> 00:01:13.941
- Flights get expensive real fast.

00:01:13.941 --> 00:01:16.283
- Can we just compare out
front pages real fast?

00:01:16.283 --> 00:01:17.975
This is my front page.

00:01:17.975 --> 00:01:18.914
- I don't want to mark something.

00:01:18.914 --> 00:01:19.997
- That's his.

00:01:21.112 --> 00:01:22.706
- You've called someone and
then immediately followed

00:01:22.706 --> 00:01:23.885
with text, who hasn't?

00:01:23.885 --> 00:01:25.761
Mom, pick up my mom phone calls.

00:01:25.761 --> 00:01:27.259
- I like how the last person
says you're worried you'll

00:01:27.259 --> 00:01:28.850
get a high score on this quiz.

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:31.350
I definitely checked that off.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.366
- I mean people, I think,
get a lot of anxiety

00:01:36.366 --> 00:01:37.681
and a lot of really stressed out

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:39.647
about what other people
are thinking about them.

00:01:39.647 --> 00:01:41.947
As soon as you're not talking
to somebody face to face,

00:01:41.947 --> 00:01:44.150
they're not thinking
about you at all anymore.

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:46.539
- I tend to reach out
to people who I trust

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:48.933
and I like express my thoughts.

00:01:48.933 --> 00:01:50.667
- Turn the negative into a positive.

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:52.775
- And don't get stuck on the
things you can't control.

00:01:52.775 --> 00:01:54.186
I think that's the biggest thing is...

00:01:54.186 --> 00:01:55.212
- Yes.

00:01:55.212 --> 00:01:56.667
- You still gotta be you and care

00:01:56.667 --> 00:01:58.961
and stress out, good stress,

00:01:58.961 --> 00:02:00.510
about things.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:03.601
- To be able to, as Taylor
Swift said, shake it off.

00:02:03.601 --> 00:02:05.339
- Here's one thing.

00:02:05.339 --> 00:02:08.382
People say I take too long in board games.

00:02:08.382 --> 00:02:11.060
But I also rarely lose.

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.560
Think about that for a second.

